WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:10.953
"I hope the compass works," Mo said.

2
00:00:10.954 --> 00:00:16.612
"Ow, ow, ow!" Mandy said. "Me too!

3
00:00:16.613 --> 00:00:22.431
This hook in my fin hurts!"

4
00:00:22.432 --> 00:00:28.110
Cora sprayed ink on the compass.

5
00:00:28.111 --> 00:00:31.069
It opened up right away.

6
00:00:31.070 --> 00:00:37.517
"Hmm," Cora said. "What's that?"

7
00:00:37.518 --> 00:00:40.439
The compass showed a picture of a box.

8
00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:44.235
The box was small and bright blue.

9
00:00:44.236 --> 00:00:48.256
"Maybe it's a treasure box," Mo said.

10
00:00:48.257 --> 00:00:51.275
"A treasure box might have tools.

11
00:00:51.276 --> 00:00:55.424
We could use tools to remove the hook!"

12
00:00:55.425 --> 00:01:01.476
"You could be right, Mo," Cora said.

13
00:01:01.477 --> 00:01:03.805
"Let's follow the arrow.

14
00:01:03.806 --> 00:01:08.654
That's the only way to find out."

15
00:01:08.655 --> 00:01:11.442
The arrow zoomed out of the cave.

16
00:01:11.443 --> 00:01:20.752
The three friends raced after it.

17
00:01:20.753 --> 00:01:23.926
Suddenly the arrow stopped.

18
00:01:23.927 --> 00:01:28.563
It pointed up at something.

19
00:01:28.564 --> 00:01:32.125
Cora looked up.

20
00:01:32.126 --> 00:01:36.517
A big, dark creature shot through the water.

21
00:01:36.518 --> 00:01:41.748
"Ahh!" Mo cried. "It's a shark!"

22
00:01:41.749 --> 00:01:48.767
The three friends darted behind some seagrass.

23
00:01:48.768 --> 00:01:52.555
They watched the big creature swim.

24
00:01:52.556 --> 00:01:58.399
"Oh!" Cora said. "It's not a shark.

25
00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:04.762
It's a human—a diver!"

26
00:02:04.763 --> 00:02:10.251
Mo gulped. "Humans are dangerous!"

27
00:02:10.252 --> 00:02:12.961
Mandy looked scared too.

28
00:02:12.962 --> 00:02:16.923
"Let's get out of here!" she said.

